# mash v0.5.5 internal CLI walk-through. Pinned renderer: vhs 0.12.1, ttyd 1.7.7-unknown, ffmpeg 9.0.2 (see README.md).
Output "demos/v055-walkthrough/out/2026-11-18-v055-walkthrough.mp4"
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1600
Set Height 960
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 0

Hide
Type "bash demos/v055-walkthrough/drive.sh --narrate"
Enter
Wait+Screen@600s /READY/
Show
Wait+Screen@1800s /DONE/
Sleep 15s
